    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat'em Up, Eat'em Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gluttony] is a 2D action roguelike with a classic cartoon art style, built on the unique concept of &quot;fighting by eating.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a cute demon of gluttony and continuously invade the FoodHell, home of the FoodDevils, to ultimately claim the throne of Food Hell for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique combat system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the onslaught of approaching Food Devils, devour them to steal their abilities, and once your stomach is full, unleash it all in a single, explosive burst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies to wear down their health, then dash into weakened foes to swallow them in one bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the type of FoodDevil you devour, you'll acquire various combat abilities known as FoodPowers. Fire french fries like a gatling gun, or plant explosive cola cans like landmines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your Satiety is maxed out from devouring enemies, you'll instantly activate a powerful ultimate move, the Belly Burst. Be warned, as using it will consume all your Food Powers, leaving your character weakened, so use it wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/98b899118968694139e3694bbdaa85f7.poster.avif?t=1754466561\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/98b899118968694139e3694bbdaa85f7.webm?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/98b899118968694139e3694bbdaa85f7.mp4?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade to complete the build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character build by selecting a random upgrade option that appears after clearing each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire a laser instead of a gatling gun, spread corruption among your enemies, or even become an immortal zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also acquire special upgrades by making deals with allies you occasionally encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/d0e2ae135f7d0307d88a6bcd69de2659.poster.avif?t=1754466561\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/d0e2ae135f7d0307d88a6bcd69de2659.webm?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/d0e2ae135f7d0307d88a6bcd69de2659.mp4?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Permanent reinforcement at the base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to stop by at your base when the difficulty feels too high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently enhance your character by trading resources obtained during combat with your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your character's base stats with Devil's Meat, acquired through regular stages, or unlock skills that strengthen your Food Powers with Boss Coins, earned by defeating bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/662abd4b5cfc51bd62e32ca84a73a930.poster.avif?t=1754466561\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/662abd4b5cfc51bd62e32ca84a73a930.webm?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/662abd4b5cfc51bd62e32ca84a73a930.mp4?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beat'em Up, Eat'em Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gluttony] is a 2D action roguelike with a classic cartoon art style, built on the unique concept of &quot;fighting by eating.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a cute demon of gluttony and continuously invade the FoodHell, home of the FoodDevils, to ultimately claim the throne of Food Hell for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique combat system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge the onslaught of approaching Food Devils, devour them to steal their abilities, and once your stomach is full, unleash it all in a single, explosive burst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies to wear down their health, then dash into weakened foes to swallow them in one bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the type of FoodDevil you devour, you'll acquire various combat abilities known as FoodPowers. Fire french fries like a gatling gun, or plant explosive cola cans like landmines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your Satiety is maxed out from devouring enemies, you'll instantly activate a powerful ultimate move, the Belly Burst. Be warned, as using it will consume all your Food Powers, leaving your character weakened, so use it wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/98b899118968694139e3694bbdaa85f7.poster.avif?t=1754466561\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/98b899118968694139e3694bbdaa85f7.webm?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806120/extras/98b899118968694139e3694bbdaa85f7.mp4?t=1754466561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=